[
  {
    "start": "00:00:00.900",
    "end": "00:00:02.190",
    "start_seconds": 0.9,
    "end_seconds": 2.19,
    "text": "Please welcome Matthew Dicks."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:06.210",
    "end": "00:00:10.170",
    "start_seconds": 6.21,
    "end_seconds": 10.17,
    "text": "I'm sitting in a straight back chair and I'm watching the greatest magic"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:10.170",
    "end": "00:00:12.300",
    "start_seconds": 10.17,
    "end_seconds": 12.3,
    "text": "show I have ever seen in my life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:12.870",
    "end": "00:00:17.850",
    "start_seconds": 12.87,
    "end_seconds": 17.85,
    "text": "The name of the Magicians are Clara and Charlie, ages seven and three."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:19.620",
    "end": "00:00:22.725",
    "start_seconds": 19.62,
    "end_seconds": 22.725,
    "text": "They have been preparing this performance for more than an hour."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:22.725",
    "end": "00:00:26.760",
    "start_seconds": 22.725,
    "end_seconds": 26.76,
    "text": "There are moving furniture and gathering props and making costumes"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:26.760",
    "end": "00:00:28.560",
    "start_seconds": 26.76,
    "end_seconds": 28.56,
    "text": "and rehearsing relentlessly."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:29.040",
    "end": "00:00:31.799",
    "start_seconds": 29.04,
    "end_seconds": 31.799,
    "text": "There's a table in the middle of the room and they've put a blanket over"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:31.799",
    "end": "00:00:36.480",
    "start_seconds": 31.799,
    "end_seconds": 36.48,
    "text": "it and on top of the blanket there's coins and cups and rubber balls"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:36.750",
    "end": "00:00:39.570",
    "start_seconds": 36.75,
    "end_seconds": 39.57,
    "text": "and an inflatable sort of rabbit."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:40.110",
    "end": "00:00:43.500",
    "start_seconds": 40.11,
    "end_seconds": 43.5,
    "text": "And Charlie is walking around with a cape made of construction paper that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:43.500",
    "end": "00:00:47.640",
    "start_seconds": 43.5,
    "end_seconds": 47.64,
    "text": "Clara has taped all over his back and they open the magic show with"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:47.640",
    "end": "00:00:52.349",
    "start_seconds": 47.64,
    "end_seconds": 52.349,
    "text": "Charlie saying, ladies and gentlemen, just over and over and over again."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:54.000",
    "end": "00:00:55.050",
    "start_seconds": 54.0,
    "end_seconds": 55.05,
    "text": "And it's amazing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:55.050",
    "end": "00:00:57.239",
    "start_seconds": 55.05,
    "end_seconds": 57.239,
    "text": "It's like a fantastic magic show."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:58.019",
    "end": "00:00:59.400",
    "start_seconds": 58.019,
    "end_seconds": 59.4,
    "text": "The magic is atrocious."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:59.400",
    "end": "00:01:02.940",
    "start_seconds": 59.4,
    "end_seconds": 62.94,
    "text": "They're like the worst, the worst magicians you've ever seen in your life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:02.940",
    "end": "00:01:05.610",
    "start_seconds": 62.94,
    "end_seconds": 65.61,
    "text": "Like every trick is worse than the last."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:05.610",
    "end": "00:01:08.610",
    "start_seconds": 65.61,
    "end_seconds": 68.61,
    "text": "There's, there's the disappearing Charlie trick where Clara takes the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:08.610",
    "end": "00:01:11.910",
    "start_seconds": 68.61,
    "end_seconds": 71.91,
    "text": "cape and she holds it in front of Charlie and she says, abracadabra."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:11.910",
    "end": "00:01:15.870",
    "start_seconds": 71.91,
    "end_seconds": 75.87,
    "text": "And Charlie runs and hides behind the couch, but he doesn't duck."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:15.870",
    "end": "00:01:18.870",
    "start_seconds": 75.87,
    "end_seconds": 78.87,
    "text": "So he's just standing there laughing when the Cape falls."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:20.370",
    "end": "00:01:23.670",
    "start_seconds": 80.37,
    "end_seconds": 83.67,
    "text": "And they're eating apples during the entire performance, like big"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:23.670",
    "end": "00:01:27.390",
    "start_seconds": 83.67,
    "end_seconds": 87.39,
    "text": "apples and little hands and every, like, everything's sticky and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:27.390",
    "end": "00:01:31.080",
    "start_seconds": 87.39,
    "end_seconds": 91.08,
    "text": "like, it's so like decidedly less professional than it really should be."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:31.920",
    "end": "00:01:34.830",
    "start_seconds": 91.92,
    "end_seconds": 94.83,
    "text": "But the worst trick is the disappearing dime trick."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:35.414",
    "end": "00:01:36.464",
    "start_seconds": 95.414,
    "end_seconds": 96.464,
    "text": "Clara holds her hand out."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:36.464",
    "end": "00:01:39.104",
    "start_seconds": 96.464,
    "end_seconds": 99.104,
    "text": "She's got a dime in it, and she says, I'm going to make this vanish."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:39.225",
    "end": "00:01:43.664",
    "start_seconds": 99.225,
    "end_seconds": 103.664,
    "text": "And she quenches her hand into a fist and then tells us to close our eyes."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:45.074",
    "end": "00:01:46.065",
    "start_seconds": 105.074,
    "end_seconds": 106.065,
    "text": "And so we do."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:46.304",
    "end": "00:01:48.554",
    "start_seconds": 106.304,
    "end_seconds": 108.554,
    "text": "And I'm wondering what she's gonna do with the dime."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:48.554",
    "end": "00:01:52.274",
    "start_seconds": 108.554,
    "end_seconds": 112.274,
    "text": "And it takes a second before I realize because she's taking the dime and she's"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:52.274",
    "end": "00:01:57.645",
    "start_seconds": 112.274,
    "end_seconds": 117.64500000000001,
    "text": "jamming it down my ear canal further than anything has ever been down my ear before."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:59.100",
    "end": "00:02:02.070",
    "start_seconds": 119.1,
    "end_seconds": 122.07,
    "text": "And after a minute she's, she says, open your eyes."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:02.070",
    "end": "00:02:05.429",
    "start_seconds": 122.07,
    "end_seconds": 125.429,
    "text": "And she's got the fist and she opens it and the dime is gone."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:05.970",
    "end": "00:02:09.780",
    "start_seconds": 125.97,
    "end_seconds": 129.78,
    "text": "And my wife, who is unaware of the assault and battery that has just taken place to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:09.780",
    "end": "00:02:12.750",
    "start_seconds": 129.78,
    "end_seconds": 132.75,
    "text": "the right of her, says, where's the dime?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:13.020",
    "end": "00:02:16.230",
    "start_seconds": 133.02,
    "end_seconds": 136.23,
    "text": "And Clara reaches behind my ear like a magician would to pluck it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:16.230",
    "end": "00:02:20.820",
    "start_seconds": 136.23,
    "end_seconds": 140.82,
    "text": "But instead, she digs deep with her index finger and gets it out."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:22.800",
    "end": "00:02:25.560",
    "start_seconds": 142.8,
    "end_seconds": 145.56,
    "text": "It's horrible and it's beautiful at the same time."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:26.655",
    "end": "00:02:29.894",
    "start_seconds": 146.655,
    "end_seconds": 149.894,
    "text": "And I look at my wife, Alicia, and she's laughing and she has tears in"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:29.894",
    "end": "00:02:32.535",
    "start_seconds": 149.894,
    "end_seconds": 152.535,
    "text": "her eyes, and I know why she has tears."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:33.015",
    "end": "00:02:36.584",
    "start_seconds": 153.015,
    "end_seconds": 156.584,
    "text": "It's because she's in the moment, like she's in the now and she's watching these"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:36.584",
    "end": "00:02:38.565",
    "start_seconds": 156.584,
    "end_seconds": 158.565,
    "text": "two brilliant children do this thing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:39.315",
    "end": "00:02:41.174",
    "start_seconds": 159.315,
    "end_seconds": 161.174,
    "text": "And I am never in the moment."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:41.894",
    "end": "00:02:44.924",
    "start_seconds": 161.894,
    "end_seconds": 164.924,
    "text": "I am a man like trapped between two worlds."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:45.255",
    "end": "00:02:51.495",
    "start_seconds": 165.255,
    "end_seconds": 171.495,
    "text": "I am forever looking to a future that I do not like or want, and at the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:51.495",
    "end": "00:02:53.685",
    "start_seconds": 171.495,
    "end_seconds": 173.685,
    "text": "same time, I'm anchored to a past."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:54.885",
    "end": "00:02:55.935",
    "start_seconds": 174.885,
    "end_seconds": 175.935,
    "text": "I can't escape."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:57.165",
    "end": "00:02:59.355",
    "start_seconds": 177.165,
    "end_seconds": 179.355,
    "text": "When I look at my kids do things like this."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:59.355",
    "end": "00:03:03.704",
    "start_seconds": 179.355,
    "end_seconds": 183.704,
    "text": "I cannot help but see these dark shadows on the edges and I can't"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:03.704",
    "end": "00:03:07.755",
    "start_seconds": 183.704,
    "end_seconds": 187.755,
    "text": "help but literally think as I watch them, that someday this family of"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:07.755",
    "end": "00:03:13.935",
    "start_seconds": 187.755,
    "end_seconds": 193.935,
    "text": "four is gonna be broken and one by one, each one of us is going to die."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:13.935",
    "end": "00:03:19.424",
    "start_seconds": 193.935,
    "end_seconds": 199.424,
    "text": "And this unforgettable moment that we're having will one day be forgotten forever."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:20.625",
    "end": "00:03:25.725",
    "start_seconds": 200.625,
    "end_seconds": 205.725,
    "text": "And I know that that is dark, like that is as dark as dark can be."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:26.445",
    "end": "00:03:30.195",
    "start_seconds": 206.445,
    "end_seconds": 210.195,
    "text": "And it's true, but it's, it's not completely black for me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:30.195",
    "end": "00:03:33.555",
    "start_seconds": 210.195,
    "end_seconds": 213.555,
    "text": "There's a little bit of hope, there's a light because there's tears in my eyes"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:33.555",
    "end": "00:03:36.285",
    "start_seconds": 213.555,
    "end_seconds": 216.285,
    "text": "too and they're not tears for the now."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:36.285",
    "end": "00:03:41.535",
    "start_seconds": 216.285,
    "end_seconds": 221.535,
    "text": "There are tears from a past, a past that has made me who I am, and it's a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:41.535",
    "end": "00:03:43.170",
    "start_seconds": 221.535,
    "end_seconds": 223.17000000000002,
    "text": "past that gives me hope for the future."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.550",
    "end": "00:03:48.960",
    "start_seconds": 224.55,
    "end_seconds": 228.96,
    "text": "In the summer of 1993, I was 22 years old and I was feeling great."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:48.960",
    "end": "00:03:50.970",
    "start_seconds": 228.96,
    "end_seconds": 230.97,
    "text": "My life was finally getting started."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:51.450",
    "end": "00:03:54.870",
    "start_seconds": 231.45,
    "end_seconds": 234.87,
    "text": "After high school, I had a lot of struggles, but I was finally getting"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:54.870",
    "end": "00:03:58.500",
    "start_seconds": 234.87,
    "end_seconds": 238.5,
    "text": "ready to go to college, and that meant I might have a chance in"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:58.500",
    "end": "00:04:00.420",
    "start_seconds": 238.5,
    "end_seconds": 240.42,
    "text": "making my childhood dreams come true."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:00.420",
    "end": "00:04:02.250",
    "start_seconds": 240.42,
    "end_seconds": 242.25,
    "text": "And they were two and they were simple."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:02.520",
    "end": "00:04:06.900",
    "start_seconds": 242.52,
    "end_seconds": 246.9,
    "text": "I wanted to be a school teacher and I wanted to be a writer, and I fought"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:06.900",
    "end": "00:04:09.450",
    "start_seconds": 246.9,
    "end_seconds": 249.45,
    "text": "like hell to get to that point."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:10.530",
    "end": "00:04:15.090",
    "start_seconds": 250.53,
    "end_seconds": 255.09,
    "text": "And then $7,000 went missing at a McDonald's where I was managing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:15.810",
    "end": "00:04:18.870",
    "start_seconds": 255.81,
    "end_seconds": 258.87,
    "text": "And although my boss didn't think I had stolen the money and my boss's"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:18.870",
    "end": "00:04:23.580",
    "start_seconds": 258.87,
    "end_seconds": 263.58,
    "text": "boss didn't think I had taken it, we ran into a police officer who did."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:24.330",
    "end": "00:04:27.330",
    "start_seconds": 264.33,
    "end_seconds": 267.33,
    "text": "And very quickly I was arrested for something I didn't"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:27.330",
    "end": "00:04:29.190",
    "start_seconds": 267.33,
    "end_seconds": 269.19,
    "text": "do, and I was put in jail."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:30.420",
    "end": "00:04:32.849",
    "start_seconds": 270.42,
    "end_seconds": 272.849,
    "text": "And when I was arraigned in front of the judge, I explained to the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:32.849",
    "end": "00:04:35.219",
    "start_seconds": 272.849,
    "end_seconds": 275.219,
    "text": "judge that I was gonna lose my job."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:35.280",
    "end": "00:04:36.690",
    "start_seconds": 275.28,
    "end_seconds": 276.69,
    "text": "So I wasn't going to have any money."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:37.365",
    "end": "00:04:40.995",
    "start_seconds": 277.365,
    "end_seconds": 280.995,
    "text": "And I was gonna lose my home because my friend was moving and I was"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:40.995",
    "end": "00:04:44.055",
    "start_seconds": 280.995,
    "end_seconds": 284.055,
    "text": "supposed to be going to the dorms and that wasn't going to happen"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:44.055",
    "end": "00:04:47.565",
    "start_seconds": 284.055,
    "end_seconds": 287.565,
    "text": "now, and I would end up homeless."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:47.835",
    "end": "00:04:48.945",
    "start_seconds": 287.835,
    "end_seconds": 288.945,
    "text": "And I didn't have a family."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:48.945",
    "end": "00:04:52.455",
    "start_seconds": 288.945,
    "end_seconds": 292.455,
    "text": "I told 'em, I didn't have parents to support me or anyone to take care of me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:53.205",
    "end": "00:04:58.875",
    "start_seconds": 293.205,
    "end_seconds": 298.875,
    "text": "But the judge told me that I couldn't have a court appointed attorney because my car,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:59.115",
    "end": "00:05:03.255",
    "start_seconds": 299.115,
    "end_seconds": 303.255,
    "text": "a 1992 Toyota Tercel, was nicer than his."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:03.675",
    "end": "00:05:04.395",
    "start_seconds": 303.675,
    "end_seconds": 304.395,
    "text": "His words."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:05.385",
    "end": "00:05:10.575",
    "start_seconds": 305.385,
    "end_seconds": 310.575,
    "text": "And so that meant I was gonna have a $25,000 legal fee, which might as"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:10.575",
    "end": "00:05:12.645",
    "start_seconds": 310.575,
    "end_seconds": 312.645,
    "text": "well have been $25 million to me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:13.395",
    "end": "00:05:16.005",
    "start_seconds": 313.395,
    "end_seconds": 316.005,
    "text": "And all the things I told the judge, what happened, happened."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:16.034",
    "end": "00:05:17.775",
    "start_seconds": 316.034,
    "end_seconds": 317.775,
    "text": "I got fired from my job."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:18.104",
    "end": "00:05:19.155",
    "start_seconds": 318.104,
    "end_seconds": 319.155,
    "text": "I lost my home."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:19.575",
    "end": "00:05:23.385",
    "start_seconds": 319.575,
    "end_seconds": 323.385,
    "text": "I lived in my car for weeks and then I caught a lucky break."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:23.805",
    "end": "00:05:26.745",
    "start_seconds": 323.805,
    "end_seconds": 326.745,
    "text": "Friends, people who used to work with me at another McDonald's, Mary"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:26.745",
    "end": "00:05:28.245",
    "start_seconds": 326.745,
    "end_seconds": 328.245,
    "text": "and Jerry, born again Christians."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:28.755",
    "end": "00:05:31.905",
    "start_seconds": 328.755,
    "end_seconds": 331.905,
    "text": "They took me in, they found out I was homeless and said, come live with us."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:31.905",
    "end": "00:05:34.275",
    "start_seconds": 331.905,
    "end_seconds": 334.275,
    "text": "And I, I lived in a room off their kitchen."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:34.695",
    "end": "00:05:38.594",
    "start_seconds": 334.695,
    "end_seconds": 338.594,
    "text": "I shared it with a guy named Rick who spoke in tongues in his sleep,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:39.284",
    "end": "00:05:42.044",
    "start_seconds": 339.284,
    "end_seconds": 342.044,
    "text": "and Mary and Jerry's indoor pet goat."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:42.945",
    "end": "00:05:46.094",
    "start_seconds": 342.945,
    "end_seconds": 346.094,
    "text": "It was actually the goat's room before Rick and I came along."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:46.094",
    "end": "00:05:47.715",
    "start_seconds": 346.094,
    "end_seconds": 347.71500000000003,
    "text": "So we couldn't complain really."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:48.825",
    "end": "00:05:50.174",
    "start_seconds": 348.825,
    "end_seconds": 350.174,
    "text": "And when I got there it was okay."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:50.174",
    "end": "00:05:51.075",
    "start_seconds": 350.174,
    "end_seconds": 351.075,
    "text": "'cause then I had a roof."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:51.075",
    "end": "00:05:53.294",
    "start_seconds": 351.075,
    "end_seconds": 353.294,
    "text": "And when you have a roof, you have an address and a phone,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:53.294",
    "end": "00:05:54.885",
    "start_seconds": 353.294,
    "end_seconds": 354.885,
    "text": "and that means you can get work."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:54.885",
    "end": "00:05:57.885",
    "start_seconds": 354.885,
    "end_seconds": 357.885,
    "text": "And so I got jobs, I worked in an office during the day."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:58.229",
    "end": "00:06:02.280",
    "start_seconds": 358.229,
    "end_seconds": 362.28,
    "text": "And I went to work at McDonald's at night because even though I was actually"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:02.340",
    "end": "00:06:06.599",
    "start_seconds": 362.34,
    "end_seconds": 366.599,
    "text": "going to be on trial for stealing money from McDonald's, this one was owned by"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:06.599",
    "end": "00:06:10.409",
    "start_seconds": 366.599,
    "end_seconds": 370.409,
    "text": "a man, Andy Chung, a franchisee, and he knew I hadn't taken the money, and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:10.409",
    "end": "00:06:12.210",
    "start_seconds": 370.409,
    "end_seconds": 372.21,
    "text": "so he gave me a job closing the store."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:12.210",
    "end": "00:06:12.710",
    "start_seconds": 372.21,
    "end_seconds": 372.71,
    "text": "At night."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:13.440",
    "end": "00:06:16.890",
    "start_seconds": 373.44,
    "end_seconds": 376.89,
    "text": "I worked 80 hours a week for more than 18 months."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:17.250",
    "end": "00:06:18.510",
    "start_seconds": 377.25,
    "end_seconds": 378.51,
    "text": "I barely saw the goat,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:21.510",
    "end": "00:06:25.885",
    "start_seconds": 381.51,
    "end_seconds": 385.885,
    "text": "and over that time, and over that time, I was just so angry."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:26.955",
    "end": "00:06:29.265",
    "start_seconds": 386.955,
    "end_seconds": 389.265,
    "text": "I was angry at my parents for not being there."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:29.505",
    "end": "00:06:33.315",
    "start_seconds": 389.505,
    "end_seconds": 393.315,
    "text": "I was angry at a police officer and a judge who had put me in this terrible"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:33.315",
    "end": "00:06:38.835",
    "start_seconds": 393.315,
    "end_seconds": 398.835,
    "text": "position, but mostly I was just angry at the world for constantly reigning bad"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:38.835",
    "end": "00:06:42.765",
    "start_seconds": 398.835,
    "end_seconds": 402.765,
    "text": "luck down upon me at the moment that I thought I was gonna finally get ahead."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:43.905",
    "end": "00:06:46.965",
    "start_seconds": 403.905,
    "end_seconds": 406.96500000000003,
    "text": "And then everything changed on April 19th."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:46.965",
    "end": "00:06:49.605",
    "start_seconds": 406.96500000000003,
    "end_seconds": 409.605,
    "text": "It was midnight and I was in McDonald's."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:49.665",
    "end": "00:06:53.325",
    "start_seconds": 409.665,
    "end_seconds": 413.325,
    "text": "I was closing the store, the doors were locked, my crew were cleaning up, and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:53.325",
    "end": "00:06:54.560",
    "start_seconds": 413.325,
    "end_seconds": 414.56,
    "text": "I was counting the money at the safe."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:55.635",
    "end": "00:07:00.015",
    "start_seconds": 415.635,
    "end_seconds": 420.015,
    "text": "I had another $7,000 in my hand and I was stuffing it into a deposit bag"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:00.015",
    "end": "00:07:01.245",
    "start_seconds": 420.015,
    "end_seconds": 421.245,
    "text": "so it could be brought to the bank."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:01.245",
    "end": "00:07:06.525",
    "start_seconds": 421.245,
    "end_seconds": 426.525,
    "text": "The next morning when I heard the crash and I knew what it was, the police had"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:06.525",
    "end": "00:07:10.425",
    "start_seconds": 426.525,
    "end_seconds": 430.425,
    "text": "come a week before to warn me about the three men who were robbing restaurants"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:10.425",
    "end": "00:07:12.465",
    "start_seconds": 430.425,
    "end_seconds": 432.465,
    "text": "in the town, and I knew about it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:12.465",
    "end": "00:07:15.765",
    "start_seconds": 432.465,
    "end_seconds": 435.765,
    "text": "My girlfriends McDonald's on the other side of town had already been robbed."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:16.185",
    "end": "00:07:18.914",
    "start_seconds": 436.185,
    "end_seconds": 438.914,
    "text": "And the Taco Bell that I could see outside my drive through"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:18.914",
    "end": "00:07:20.534",
    "start_seconds": 438.914,
    "end_seconds": 440.534,
    "text": "window had been robbed a week ago."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:20.534",
    "end": "00:07:22.724",
    "start_seconds": 440.534,
    "end_seconds": 442.724,
    "text": "And in that robbery, they had killed someone."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:23.640",
    "end": "00:07:28.200",
    "start_seconds": 443.64,
    "end_seconds": 448.2,
    "text": "So when I heard the glass break, I knew who was coming for me and I"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:28.200",
    "end": "00:07:30.330",
    "start_seconds": 448.2,
    "end_seconds": 450.33,
    "text": "made the worst decision of my life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:30.930",
    "end": "00:07:34.830",
    "start_seconds": 450.93,
    "end_seconds": 454.83,
    "text": "I took that bag full of that money and I reached into the back of the safe,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:35.310",
    "end": "00:07:39.090",
    "start_seconds": 455.31,
    "end_seconds": 459.09000000000003,
    "text": "and I dropped it down the slot that sent it to a compartment at the bottom"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:39.090",
    "end": "00:07:40.215",
    "start_seconds": 459.09000000000003,
    "end_seconds": 460.21500000000003,
    "text": "of the safe that I couldn't open."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:41.985",
    "end": "00:07:45.015",
    "start_seconds": 461.985,
    "end_seconds": 465.015,
    "text": "And then they were in the room with me and they had brought my crew members,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:45.015",
    "end": "00:07:48.675",
    "start_seconds": 465.015,
    "end_seconds": 468.675,
    "text": "two Haitian brothers who couldn't speak any English, and a girl named Francis,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:48.675",
    "end": "00:07:52.335",
    "start_seconds": 468.675,
    "end_seconds": 472.335,
    "text": "an 18-year-old girl who I would take to the prom a month later because her mother"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:52.335",
    "end": "00:07:54.015",
    "start_seconds": 472.335,
    "end_seconds": 474.015,
    "text": "didn't trust her with anyone but me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:54.615",
    "end": "00:07:58.425",
    "start_seconds": 474.615,
    "end_seconds": 478.425,
    "text": "And they had us all lie down on this greasy red tile floor."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:58.695",
    "end": "00:08:04.724",
    "start_seconds": 478.695,
    "end_seconds": 484.724,
    "text": "Three men in black shirts and black pants and white sneakers and big black guns."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:05.325",
    "end": "00:08:07.905",
    "start_seconds": 485.325,
    "end_seconds": 487.905,
    "text": "And they started to open the safe and take out the money."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:08.145",
    "end": "00:08:10.484",
    "start_seconds": 488.145,
    "end_seconds": 490.484,
    "text": "And they realized very quickly that there wasn't enough money"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:10.484",
    "end": "00:08:11.625",
    "start_seconds": 490.484,
    "end_seconds": 491.625,
    "text": "here, that something was wrong."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:11.625",
    "end": "00:08:14.265",
    "start_seconds": 491.625,
    "end_seconds": 494.265,
    "text": "And so they grabbed me and picked me up and they told me"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:14.265",
    "end": "00:08:15.765",
    "start_seconds": 494.265,
    "end_seconds": 495.765,
    "text": "to open that bottom compartment."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:16.275",
    "end": "00:08:17.505",
    "start_seconds": 496.275,
    "end_seconds": 497.505,
    "text": "And I told them I couldn't."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:17.775",
    "end": "00:08:22.275",
    "start_seconds": 497.775,
    "end_seconds": 502.275,
    "text": "There's a, there was a plaque and I said, manager, can't open owner has a key."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:22.275",
    "end": "00:08:23.474",
    "start_seconds": 502.275,
    "end_seconds": 503.474,
    "text": "And they didn't believe me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:23.864",
    "end": "00:08:26.625",
    "start_seconds": 503.864,
    "end_seconds": 506.625,
    "text": "And so they started to beat me with the guns and they started to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:26.625",
    "end": "00:08:28.905",
    "start_seconds": 506.625,
    "end_seconds": 508.905,
    "text": "kick me and I pleaded with them."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:29.850",
    "end": "00:08:31.830",
    "start_seconds": 509.85,
    "end_seconds": 511.83,
    "text": "That they would believe me that I couldn't open it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:32.429",
    "end": "00:08:37.590",
    "start_seconds": 512.429,
    "end_seconds": 517.59,
    "text": "And then I felt a gun pushed up against my head, and I heard one of them"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:37.590",
    "end": "00:08:42.419",
    "start_seconds": 517.59,
    "end_seconds": 522.419,
    "text": "say that, I'm gonna count back from three and then I'm gonna shoot you in"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:42.419",
    "end": "00:08:44.970",
    "start_seconds": 522.419,
    "end_seconds": 524.97,
    "text": "the head if you don't open that box."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:45.960",
    "end": "00:08:50.250",
    "start_seconds": 525.96,
    "end_seconds": 530.25,
    "text": "And as they counted back from three, I begged this man to believe me that I"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:50.250",
    "end": "00:08:56.939",
    "start_seconds": 530.25,
    "end_seconds": 536.939,
    "text": "could not get the money as he counted 3, 2, 1, and then there was a click."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:57.870",
    "end": "00:09:00.569",
    "start_seconds": 537.87,
    "end_seconds": 540.569,
    "text": "It was the loudest click in the history of the world."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:02.339",
    "end": "00:09:06.120",
    "start_seconds": 542.339,
    "end_seconds": 546.12,
    "text": "And then they laughed and I cried and they threw me to the ground and I"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:06.120",
    "end": "00:09:10.349",
    "start_seconds": 546.12,
    "end_seconds": 550.349,
    "text": "tried to crawl away 'cause I couldn't talk anymore and I couldn't breathe."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:10.829",
    "end": "00:09:13.859",
    "start_seconds": 550.829,
    "end_seconds": 553.859,
    "text": "And they pulled me back and they hit me more."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:14.520",
    "end": "00:09:19.949",
    "start_seconds": 554.52,
    "end_seconds": 559.949,
    "text": "And then I felt a gun press into my head and push my face down onto that tile."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:21.000",
    "end": "00:09:22.584",
    "start_seconds": 561.0,
    "end_seconds": 562.584,
    "text": "And he said, this time there's a bullet."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:24.060",
    "end": "00:09:28.230",
    "start_seconds": 564.06,
    "end_seconds": 568.23,
    "text": "And I'm gonna shoot you if you don't open that box for McDonald's money."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:28.410",
    "end": "00:09:29.970",
    "start_seconds": 568.41,
    "end_seconds": 569.97,
    "text": "So open the safe."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:30.930",
    "end": "00:09:37.770",
    "start_seconds": 570.93,
    "end_seconds": 577.77,
    "text": "And as he started to count back from three, I felt all the fear and anger in me"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:37.770",
    "end": "00:09:42.600",
    "start_seconds": 577.77,
    "end_seconds": 582.6,
    "text": "just roll over to sadness and to regret."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:43.410",
    "end": "00:09:49.080",
    "start_seconds": 583.41,
    "end_seconds": 589.08,
    "text": "I was a 22-year-old kid on a greasy tile floor and I was going to die"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:49.080",
    "end": "00:09:51.570",
    "start_seconds": 589.08,
    "end_seconds": 591.57,
    "text": "having done nothing with my life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:52.530",
    "end": "00:09:54.600",
    "start_seconds": 592.53,
    "end_seconds": 594.6,
    "text": "And I would be forgotten by everyone."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:56.670",
    "end": "00:10:00.689",
    "start_seconds": 596.67,
    "end_seconds": 600.689,
    "text": "And when he hit zero, there was another click and they laughed"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:00.689",
    "end": "00:10:02.700",
    "start_seconds": 600.689,
    "end_seconds": 602.7,
    "text": "some more and I just wept."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:04.410",
    "end": "00:10:05.430",
    "start_seconds": 604.41,
    "end_seconds": 605.43,
    "text": "And then they were gone."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:07.439",
    "end": "00:10:13.319",
    "start_seconds": 607.439,
    "end_seconds": 613.319,
    "text": "And for the next 15 years, I suffered from post-traumatic stress disorder until I met"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:13.319",
    "end": "00:10:17.610",
    "start_seconds": 613.319,
    "end_seconds": 617.61,
    "text": "my wife and she told me that I probably shouldn't wake up every night screaming."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:17.939",
    "end": "00:10:18.839",
    "start_seconds": 617.939,
    "end_seconds": 618.8389999999999,
    "text": "And I said, no."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:18.839",
    "end": "00:10:23.490",
    "start_seconds": 618.8389999999999,
    "end_seconds": 623.49,
    "text": "It's like my thing, like some people collect stamps and some people"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:23.490",
    "end": "00:10:25.469",
    "start_seconds": 623.49,
    "end_seconds": 625.469,
    "text": "play tennis and this is what I do."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:26.819",
    "end": "00:10:29.370",
    "start_seconds": 626.819,
    "end_seconds": 629.37,
    "text": "And she said, no, that's not actually a thing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:30.300",
    "end": "00:10:33.240",
    "start_seconds": 630.3,
    "end_seconds": 633.24,
    "text": "And she sent me to someone and I got a little better."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:34.425",
    "end": "00:10:39.255",
    "start_seconds": 634.425,
    "end_seconds": 639.255,
    "text": "And six months after the robbery, I was found not guilty in a court of law, and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:39.255",
    "end": "00:10:42.255",
    "start_seconds": 639.255,
    "end_seconds": 642.255,
    "text": "I restarted my life and I was relentless."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:42.584",
    "end": "00:10:44.025",
    "start_seconds": 642.5840000000001,
    "end_seconds": 644.025,
    "text": "I paid off my debt."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:44.265",
    "end": "00:10:45.915",
    "start_seconds": 644.265,
    "end_seconds": 645.915,
    "text": "I got myself back to college."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:45.915",
    "end": "00:10:50.265",
    "start_seconds": 645.915,
    "end_seconds": 650.265,
    "text": "And in 1999 I graduated and I became an elementary school teacher."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:50.535",
    "end": "00:10:53.775",
    "start_seconds": 650.535,
    "end_seconds": 653.775,
    "text": "And for the last 18 years, hundreds of kids have passed"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:53.775",
    "end": "00:10:54.915",
    "start_seconds": 653.775,
    "end_seconds": 654.915,
    "text": "through my classroom door."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:55.605",
    "end": "00:10:59.745",
    "start_seconds": 655.605,
    "end_seconds": 659.745,
    "text": "And in 2009, I published my first novel, something Missing,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:00.135",
    "end": "00:11:01.514",
    "start_seconds": 660.135,
    "end_seconds": 661.514,
    "text": "and I've published 3 cent."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:04.380",
    "end": "00:11:09.000",
    "start_seconds": 664.38,
    "end_seconds": 669.0,
    "text": "A long time ago, there was a boy lying on a greasy tile floor thinking"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:09.000",
    "end": "00:11:12.359",
    "start_seconds": 669.0,
    "end_seconds": 672.359,
    "text": "that his life was gonna be over and he will have accomplished nothing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:13.020",
    "end": "00:11:17.310",
    "start_seconds": 673.02,
    "end_seconds": 677.31,
    "text": "And somehow I managed to make those childhood dreams come true."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:18.959",
    "end": "00:11:27.839",
    "start_seconds": 678.959,
    "end_seconds": 687.8389999999999,
    "text": "And yet so much of me now, like all of me now, is still lying on that tile floor."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:30.074",
    "end": "00:11:36.915",
    "start_seconds": 690.074,
    "end_seconds": 696.915,
    "text": "No matter how much success I've had in my life, I live with a constant ringing"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:36.915",
    "end": "00:11:45.045",
    "start_seconds": 696.915,
    "end_seconds": 705.045,
    "text": "fear that there will be a day not too far in the future when I will be in"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:45.045",
    "end": "00:11:51.495",
    "start_seconds": 705.045,
    "end_seconds": 711.495,
    "text": "those last moments of my life, and that I will feel the same regret that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:51.495",
    "end": "00:11:54.464",
    "start_seconds": 711.495,
    "end_seconds": 714.4639999999999,
    "text": "I felt that day in that McDonald's."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:55.665",
    "end": "00:11:57.285",
    "start_seconds": 715.665,
    "end_seconds": 717.285,
    "text": "And so when I wake up every morning."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:57.975",
    "end": "00:12:04.454",
    "start_seconds": 717.975,
    "end_seconds": 724.454,
    "text": "I wake up in fear that I will not fill this day with enough"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:05.235",
    "end": "00:12:07.064",
    "start_seconds": 725.235,
    "end_seconds": 727.064,
    "text": "to make that regret go away."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:08.895",
    "end": "00:12:13.785",
    "start_seconds": 728.895,
    "end_seconds": 733.785,
    "text": "I'm a, I've spent my life chasing a horizon that I cannot"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:13.785",
    "end": "00:12:17.415",
    "start_seconds": 733.785,
    "end_seconds": 737.415,
    "text": "catch, and so that is what I do."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:17.985",
    "end": "00:12:25.515",
    "start_seconds": 737.985,
    "end_seconds": 745.515,
    "text": "I fill every day that I have with writing and with teaching, and with beautiful."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:26.160",
    "end": "00:12:28.320",
    "start_seconds": 746.16,
    "end_seconds": 748.32,
    "text": "Terrible magic shows"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:30.570",
    "end": "00:12:36.570",
    "start_seconds": 750.57,
    "end_seconds": 756.57,
    "text": "and I hope and I pray that someday it will be enough."
